Test your own apps with Shannon, an AI pentester

Usage: wally shannon [OPTIONS] [args...]

Arguments:
  args                        Shannon's own command and options; with none,
                              start

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
  -m, --model TEXT            A model from your account (default: your default
                              model)

Examples:
  # Scan a target you are authorised to test (starts a scan)
  wally shannon -- -u https://staging.example.com -r ./my-repo

  # Choose the model for the scan
  wally shannon -m glm-5.3-flash -- -u https://staging.example.com -r ./my-repo

  # List running and finished scans
  wally shannon -- scans

  # Follow a scan's log
  wally shannon -- logs my-scan
